# ISP proxy pool — flat-rate static-residential IPs (unlimited bandwidth each).
# Copy this file to `isp_proxies.txt` (gitignored) and paste your IPRoyal ISP export, ONE endpoint per line.
# Accepted per-line formats (any of):
#   host:port:user:pass          <- IPRoyal dashboard export
#   user:pass@host:port
#   http://user:pass@host:port
# Lines starting with # are ignored. resi.isp_pool() reads this automatically.
#
# example (fake):
# 96.126.181.103:12323:myuser:mypass
# 173.208.12.5:12323:myuser:mypass
